    "html": "<h1>Quick start</h1>\n<p>At the beginning, you need to:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Be familiar with the Rust language.</li>\n<li>Know the general process of PHP extension development.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Here the tutorial will not explain the installation methods of Rust and PHP.</p>",
